          "text": "<p class=\"p1\" style=\"font: 400 12px Helvetica; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">What does belonging look like? My research focuses on the sense of belonging among people who pursue change in museums, but mapping your sense of belonging can be difficult. The people I interviewed have boldly risen to the challenge, and l'd like to invite you to do the same.</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"font: 400 12px Helvetica; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"font: 400 12px Helvetica; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Instead of thinking about museums, think about your sense of belonging at FSU. What makes you feel you belong here? What makes you feel you do not?</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"font: 400 12px Helvetica; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"font: 400 12px Helvetica; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Rather than making a map, join us in making a tapestry of the FSU community's sense of belonging by grabbing a strip of paper, writing something down, and adding your note to the chains.</p>"
